<Base
  title="work | Tom Frodyma"
  description="Tom Frodyma's work: AI product manager at Change AI, before that AI specialist, project manager, and sales agent at Change."
>
  <h1 class="sr-only">Work</h1>
  <p><span class="nick">&lt;tom&gt;</span> my work. every job a quest line.</p>
  <p>
    I build AI products for customer service. I started at Change in 2024 and
    moved from sales into product by building and maintaining what my teams
    needed: dashboards, automations, and eventually full applications.
  </p>

  <div class="frame">
    <h2 class="frame-title">AI product manager, Change AI</h2>
    <p class="status">
      <span class="ok">current</span>,
      <span class="dim">jun 2025 - present, Plzeň, remote</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      Product manager for Change AI's customer-service AI products. I own
      MailMate, an AI email-drafting tool used by enterprise customer-service
      teams. I also redesigned and shipped the frontend of IPM, our AI
      quality-management tool.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="frame">
    <h2 class="frame-title">AI specialist, Change</h2>
    <p class="status">
      <span class="ok">current</span>,
      <span class="dim">jun 2025 - present, Plzeň, remote</span>
    </p>
    <p>
      I help teams across Change implement AI. I'm currently completing the
      Cognigy partner certification to implement conversational AI for new
      clients.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="frame">
    <h2 class="frame-title">project manager, Change</h2>
    <p class="status"><span class="dim">aug 2024 - jun 2025, Plzeň, remote</span></p>
    <p>
      Project manager for the Marktplaats SMB team. I helped standardize the
      sales process, monitored quality with an AI quality-management tool, and
      replaced manual reporting with Power BI and SharePoint dashboards.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="frame">
    <h2 class="frame-title">sales agent, Change</h2>
    <p class="status"><span class="dim">feb 2024 - sep 2024, Plzeň, remote</span></p>
    <p>
      Outbound B2B sales for Marktplaats. I built a sales dashboard using Power
      Automate, SharePoint, and forms so the whole team logged results in one
      place, which pulled me into coaching and process work.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="frame">
    <h2 class="frame-title">planner, Van Krieken Koffie</h2>
    <p class="status"><span class="dim">mar 2023 - dec 2023, Kaatsheuvel, Netherlands</span></p>
    <p>
      Scheduled and coordinated field technicians servicing coffee equipment
      for B2B clients.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="frame">
    <h2 class="frame-title">sales associate, Frodyma Tuinplanten</h2>
    <p class="status"><span class="dim">apr 2020 - dec 2022, Kaatsheuvel, Netherlands</span></p>
    <p>Sales and customer advice at my family's garden-plant business.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>top skills</h2>
  <p>
    Product Management, AI Implementation, Prototyping, Product Development,
    Conversational AI
  </p>

  <h2>education</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>SintLucas: Graphic Design, Game and Interactive Media Design (2019-2020)</li>
    <li>Koning Willem I College: Sales, Selling Skills and Sales Operations</li>
  </ul>
</Base>

<style>
  h2.frame-title {
    margin: 0;
